      "openalex_id": "W1571242416",
      "doi": "10.1111/heyj.12272",
      "title": "An English Source of German Romanticism: Herder's Cudworth Inspired Revision of Spinoza from \u2018Plastik\u2019 to \u2018Kraft\u2019",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Alexander J. B. Hampton",
          "openalex_id": "A5076155470",
